1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
99 個間距。最短配置會碰到邊個刻度？
Ninety-nine gaps. Where does the shortest packing land?

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,800
兩個根式可以化做圓弧上嘅一點。
Two square roots become one point on a circular arc.

3
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:12,000
睇住圖像點樣變，再將觀察寫成解法。
Watch how the picture changes, then turn the observation into a proof.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:22,000
同一個函數套用 n 次。每一步有哪個量容易追蹤？
Apply the same function n times. What quantity is easy to track?

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:33,000
對非零輸入取平方的倒數，每次只會加 1。
For a nonzero input, its reciprocal square increases by one.

6
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:43,000
例如由 x＝1 或 x＝−1 出發，兩者的倒數平方都由 1 開始。
For x = 1 or −1, the reciprocal square starts at one.

7
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:55,000
每套用一次函數，黃點就右移一格。n 次就加 n。
Each application moves the dot one tick right. After n steps, add n.

8
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:05,000
分母永遠為正，函數保留輸入的符號。零則一直是零。
The denominator is positive, so the sign stays fixed. Zero stays zero.

9
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:14,000
得到含分子 x 的公式。代入 x＝0 也成立。
The numerator is x. The same formula also holds at x = 0.

10
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:24,000
原卷 A 至 D 的分子都印成 1。代入零，它們都給 1。
The printed options A through D each have numerator 1 and give 1 at zero.

11
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:33,000
獨立題解的公式正確，但標了 D。按這份原卷應選 E。
The companion labels the right formula D. The printed paper gives E.

12
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:42,000
E：以上皆非。核對選項時，記住分子是 x。
E: none of the above. The derived formula has numerator x.

13
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:50,000
三個式子有同一個值，先把它叫做 t。
The three expressions share a value. Call it t.

14
00:01:50,000 --> 00:02:00,000
按各自的底數還原成冪，三邊的指數都是 t。
Use each base to undo its logarithm. The exponent is always t.

15
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:12,000
同指數的冪相乘，可以先乘底數。3 乘 5 就是 15。
With a common exponent, multiply the bases first: 3 times 5 is 15.

16
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:24,000
把三個冪換回 a、b，得到 a＋b＝1125ab。
Substitute the three powers to obtain a + b = 1125ab.

17
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:37,000
a、b 都是正數，可以除以 ab。答案是 B，1125。
Both variables are positive. Divide by ab to get B, 1125.

18
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:46,000
數列每次乘的因數會變。找出哪個部分令它一直變。
The multiplier changes at each step. Which part makes it change?

19
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:56,000
新項和舊項分別除以 n＋2 和 n＋1，剩下固定的倍數 2。
Divide by n + 2 and n + 1 respectively. The multiplier is now 2.

20
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:06,000
第一個除完是 1，之後每一步倍增。
The first scaled term is one. Each later term doubles.

21
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:16,000
第 n 個除完是 2 的 n−1 次方。乘回 n＋1 就得原項。
The nth scaled term is 2 to the n−1. Multiply back by n + 1.

22
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:26,000
為了求和，把每一項寫成兩個相鄰端點之差。
To sum the terms, write each one as a difference of adjacent endpoints.

23
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:38,000
看首三項：前一段的右端，就是下一段的左端。
In the first three terms, each right endpoint becomes the next left endpoint.

24
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:49,000
中間端點成對相消。從 0 到最後一個端點，只剩 2023·2²⁰²³。
The shared endpoints cancel. From zero to the last endpoint, only 2023·2²⁰²³ remains.

25
00:03:49,000 --> 00:04:07,000
分子是 2025·2²⁰²³。約去相同的冪，答案是 C。
The numerator is 2025·2²⁰²³. Cancel the shared power and choose C.

26
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:17,000
100 個遞增整數之間有 99 個間距，每個至少是 1。
The 100 increasing integers have 99 gaps, each at least one.

27
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:28,000
所有間距相加等於首尾距離，最多只有 399。
The gaps add to the distance between the endpoints, at most 399.

28
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:48,000
反過來假設每種間距最多用 14 次。把最短的放在前面。
Assume every size occurs at most 14 times. Put the smallest sizes first.

29
00:04:48,000 --> 00:05:00,000
最短的七種各用 14 次，已經有 98 個。還欠一個。
Fourteen copies of each of the seven smallest sizes fill 98 slots. One remains.

30
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:11,000
再短也得用 8。若第 j 個更短，就會超過某個大小的次數上限。
The last gap must be at least 8. Any shorter sorted gap would break a cap.

31
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:21,000
即使用最省的排法，總長仍要 14 乘 28，再加 8，等於 400。
Even this cheapest arrangement requires 14 times 28, plus 8, or 400.

32
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:35,000
原來只能容納 399。把末端放大，就看到多出的 1。
The span allows only 399. Zoom in on the extra one unit.

33
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:52,000
假設行不通。所以至少一種間距出現了 15 次。
The assumption fails. At least one gap size occurs 15 or more times.

34
00:05:52,000 --> 00:06:00,000
要求最大可行的 k，就要找左邊根式和的最大值。
The largest feasible k is the maximum of the sum of the two roots.

35
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:10,000
要令兩個根式都有定義，x 必須在 3 至 6 之間。
Both square roots are real exactly when x is between 3 and 6.

36
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:21,000
x 移動時，兩段長一增一減。它們的和固定為 3。
When x moves, one length grows as the other shrinks. Their sum is three.

37
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:30,000
以 u、v 表示兩個根式。它們的平方和固定為 3。
Let u and v be the roots. Their squares add to three.

38
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:41,000
所有可行點都在第一象限的四分之一圓弧上，包括端點。
The feasible points form a quarter-circle, including its endpoints.

39
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:51,000
沿圓弧移動黃點，看看 u＋v 的直線何時推得最遠。
Move the point along the arc and see when its diagonal line reaches farthest.

40
00:06:51,000 --> 00:07:00,000
回到對角線 u＝v。黃線在這裡和圓弧相切。
At u = v, the yellow line is tangent to the arc.

41
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:08,000
代數亦證明了上界：平方差項非負，只有 u＝v 時取等號。
The square term is nonnegative. Equality holds exactly when u = v.

42
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:17,000
因此 x＝九除以二時達到最大值，最大可行的 k 是根號 6。
The maximum occurs at x = 9/2, so the largest feasible k is √6.

43
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:30,000
正整數 a、b、c 滿足這條等式。總和為何一定是完全平方數？
Positive integers a, b and c satisfy this equation. Why must their sum be a square?

44
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:44,000
同乘 ab。分母 b 消掉後餘下 a，分母 a 消掉後餘下 b。
Multiply by ab. Cancelling b leaves a, and cancelling a leaves b.

45
00:07:44,000 --> 00:08:00,000
展開後，把立方項留在左邊，其餘項移到右邊。
Expand. Keep the cubic terms on the left and move the other terms to the right.

46
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:17,000
左邊先提出 a+b。右邊前三項是和的平方，也含有這個因子。
Factor out a+b on the left. The square of the sum on the right shares that factor.

47
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:30,000
a+b 大於零，兩邊除以它。差的平方就是三數的和。
Since a+b is positive, divide both sides by it. The squared difference is the sum.

48
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:42,000
取一組符合原式的數：5、1、10。先把它們畫成三組方格。
Take a valid example: 5, 1 and 10. Draw the numbers as three groups of tiles.

49
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:58,000
保留每一格，把三組合成正方形。這個例子的邊長是 4。
Keep every tile and assemble the three groups into a square. Its example side length is 4.

50
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:12,000
一般的邊長是整數 |a−b|。它不能是零，因為 a+b+c 大於零。
The general side length is the integer |a−b|. It is nonzero because a+b+c is positive.

51
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:25,000
兩組平方和都被 p 整除。證明下面兩式恰有一式被 p 整除。
Both sums of squares are multiples of p. Show that exactly one expression below is too.

52
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:41,000
b 和 d 在模 p 下有乘法逆元，所以可用 r 和 s 表示兩個比值。
b and d have inverses modulo p. Use r and s for the two ratios.

53
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:45,000
兩個平方相等。相減後把平方差分解成兩個因子。
Subtract the equal squares and factor the difference of squares.

54
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:57,000
模素數下，乘積為零就有一個因子為零，所以兩根相同或相反。
Modulo a prime, a zero product has a zero factor. The roots are equal or opposite.

55
00:09:57,000 --> 00:10:10,000
模 5 做例子。2 和 −2 的平方都餘 4，也就是 −1。
Modulo 5, both 2 and −2 square to 4, the same residue as −1.

56
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:25,000
先把 s 放在同一個根。兩根相乘再加 1 得 0，兩根相加仍非零。
Put s at the same root. Multiply the roots and add 1 to get 0. Their sum stays nonzero.

57
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:39,000
再把 s 放到另一個根。這次兩根相加得 0，乘積加 1 得 2。
Put s at the opposite root. Now their sum is 0, while their product plus 1 is 2.

58
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:48,000
一般來說，把 s=r 和 s=−r 代入，再用 r 的平方等於 −1。
In general, substitute s=r or s=−r and use that r squared is −1.

59
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:56,000
p 是奇素數，r 也非零，所以模 p 下，2 和 2r 都非零。
p is odd and r is nonzero, so 2 and 2r are nonzero modulo p.

60
00:10:56,000 --> 00:11:06,000
兩式都乘以可逆的 bd，每一行仍只有一個零。
Multiply by the invertible factor bd. Each row still has one zero.

61
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:17,000
無論是哪一行，都恰有一個原式被 p 整除。
In either case, exactly one original expression is divisible by p.

62
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:31,000
若每段長 n 的連續項之和可被 n+1 整除，是否有這樣的正整數數列？
Could a positive integer sequence have every n-term sum divisible by n+1?

63
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:48,000
任意取整數 m 大於或等於 2。先看由首項開始、長度為 2m−1 的區段。
Choose any integer m at least 2. Start with a block of 2m−1 terms from the first term.

64
00:11:48,000 --> 00:12:02,000
長區段的和 S 可被 2m 整除，所以也可被 m 整除。
The long sum S is divisible by 2m, so it is also divisible by m.

65
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:18,000
首項之後，剛好餘下兩段各 m−1 項。把兩段和分別叫作 U 和 V。
After the first term come two blocks of m−1 terms. Call their sums U and V.

66
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:35,000
每段長 m−1，因此 U 和 V 都可被 m 整除。將兩段從 S 移開。
Each small block has length m−1, so m divides U and V. Remove both blocks from S.

67
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:53,000
把 S 減去兩個 m 的倍數，剩下的首項 a₁ 也必定是 m 的倍數。
Subtract two multiples of m from S. The first term left over must also be a multiple of m.

68
00:12:53,000 --> 00:13:10,000
m 原本可任意選。取 m=a₁+1，它比正整數 a₁ 大。
m was arbitrary. Choose m=a₁+1, which is larger than the positive integer a₁.

69
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:32,000
較大的正整數不能整除較小的正整數，因此數列不存在。
A larger positive integer cannot divide a smaller one. No such sequence exists.

70
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:46,000
四個正數共用一個比值，總和等於 48。
Four positive numbers share one ratio and sum to 48.

71
00:13:46,000 --> 00:14:02,000
把四個數相乘設為 P。第一個分子缺少 w。
Set P = xyzw. The first numerator omits w.

72
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:18,000
每條箭嘴都用同一個函數。輸入越大，輸出越細。
Each arrow uses the same function. Larger input gives smaller output.

73
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:36,000
假設 x 大過 z。兩個輸出 y、w 嘅大小順序就調轉。
Suppose x > z. Their outputs y and w have the reverse order.

74
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:53,000
再行一步，次序又反轉一次，得到 z 大過 x。
One more step reverses the order again and gives z > x.

75
00:14:53,000 --> 00:15:10,000
大過或者細過都會矛盾，所以 x 等於 z，y 等於 w。
Either strict order leads to a contradiction, so x = z and y = w.

76
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:28,000
代入兩個相等關係，再交叉相乘。
Substitute the equalities and cross-multiply.

77
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:46,000
在 x＋y＝24 上找交點。先看 x＝y 呢一支。
On x + y = 24, first intersect the branch x = y.

78
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:57,000
再畫 xy＝1。兩個交點好近座標軸。
Now plot xy = 1. Two intersections lie close to the axes.

79
00:15:57,000 --> 00:16:12,000
將靠近 y 軸嘅交點放大。另一個交點由交換 x、y 得到。
Zoom in near the y-axis. Swapping x and y gives the other point.

80
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:27,000
兩數和係 24，積係 1。用同一條二次式一次過求兩個根。
The sum is 24 and the product is 1. One quadratic gives both roots.

81
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:42,000
所以有一組四個 12，同兩組大小數交替排列嘅解。
One solution has four 12s. The other two alternate the roots.

82
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:57,000
三組都係正數，亦滿足兩支之一。代回四個比值都成立。
All three are positive, and each branch gives the original equal ratios.

83
00:16:57,000 --> 00:17:07,000
從一個銳角三角形開始，令 AB 長於 AC。
Start with an acute triangle where AB is longer than AC.

84
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:19,000
I 是內心。從 B 作角平分線，再標出 BC 的中點 M。
Bisect angle B to reach incenter I. Mark M, the midpoint of BC.

85
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:31,000
延長 MI 至 AC 得到 D。延長 BI 至外接圓得到 E。
Extend MI to AC at D, and BI to the circumcircle at E.

86
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:43,000
比較橙色的 ED 除以 EI，以及藍色的 IC 除以 IB。
Compare orange ED over EI with blue IC over IB.

87
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:57,000
讓 A 水平移動。每一幀都用新三角形重算交點和比值。
Slide A horizontally. The intersections and ratios recompute from each new triangle.

88
00:17:57,000 --> 00:18:15,000
兩個比值一路變小，但始終重合。停下來找原因。
Both ratios decrease together. Freeze the triangle to explain why they agree.

89
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:29,000
先看靠近底邊的三角形 MCD。設 b 為 CA，s 為半周長，r 為內切圓半徑。
Focus on triangle MCD. Let b be CA, s the semiperimeter, and r the inradius.

90
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:43,000
M 到 AC 的高是 B 到 AC 的一半，等於 sr 除以 b。
M is half as far from AC as B is. Its height above AC is sr over b.

91
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:57,000
半周長大於 b，所以 M 離 AC 比 I 遠。I 正好在 M 與 D 之間。
Since s exceeds b, M is farther from AC than I is. So I lies between M and D.

92
00:18:57,000 --> 00:19:11,000
沿 IC 分成兩塊。用 MC 和 CD 做底，兩塊的高同樣是 r。
Split along IC. Using MC and CD as bases, both pieces have height r.

93
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:25,000
同一個面積用兩種方法計算。約去 r，就找到 CD 與 BC 的比。
The same area has two expressions. Cancel r to find the ratio CD to BC.

94
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:39,000
回到外接圓。B 的角平分線截出兩段等弧，所以 EA 等於 EC。
Return to the circumcircle. The bisector at B cuts off equal arcs, so EA equals EC.

95
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:54,000
在 I 用外角，在 C 加兩個角。兩處都得到 β 加 γ，所以 EI 也等於 EC。
Use the exterior angle at I and add angles at C. Both give beta plus gamma.

96
00:19:54,000 --> 00:20:07,000
將 E 投影到 AC，把 I 投影到 BC。兩個直角三角形都用同一個 β。
Project E onto AC and I onto BC. Both right triangles use the same angle beta.

97
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:21,000
G 是內切圓的切點。用每個頂點的兩條切線等長，得到 BG 等於 s 減 b。
G is the incircle’s contact point. Equal tangents give BG = s − b.

98
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:36,000
兩組夾邊成比例，夾角都是 β，所以這兩個三角形相似。
The sides around angle beta are proportional. The triangles are similar by SAS.

99
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:49,000
把橙色三角形反轉，再按同一比例放大，三個對應頂點就會重合。
Flip the orange triangle and enlarge it uniformly until corresponding vertices coincide.

100
00:20:49,000 --> 00:21:00,000
對應邊給出 ED 比 IC 等於 EC 比 IB。以 EI 代替 EC，再整理。
Similarity gives ED/IC = EC/IB. Replace EC with EI and rearrange.

101
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:07,000
面積定出比例，弧中點補上等長線段，最後用相似把兩者連起來。
Area gives a ratio, the arc midpoint gives equal lengths, and similarity joins them.

102
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:20,000
每三個相鄰項都受同一條不等式限制。
The same inequality constrains every three consecutive terms.

103
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:35,000
令 b 等於 a 減 1。正數條件變成每一項 b 都大過 −1。
Set b = a − 1. Positivity gives b > −1 at every index.

104
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:50,000
如果中間項 b_k 大過零，左右兩項嘅乘積一定係負數。
If bₖ is positive, the product of its neighbours is negative.

105
00:21:50,000 --> 00:22:05,000
因此一邊要正，另一邊要負。左右兩個情況都要計。
Exactly one neighbour is positive. Either side can be the positive one.

106
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:22,000
若 k 至少係 3，相鄰嘅正項同 k 都至少係第 2 項。
For k ≥ 3, both positive terms have indices at least 2.

107
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:34,000
左右外側都要負。因為 b 大過 −1，兩個下降量都細過 1。
The outer terms are negative. Both deficits are less than 1.

108
00:22:34,000 --> 00:22:51,000
對 u 套不等式。左跌幅少過 1，所以 v 必須大過 2u。
Apply the inequality at u. The left deficit is below 1, so v > 2u.

109
00:22:51,000 --> 00:23:07,000
換到 v 套同一條不等式，得到 u 亦必須大過 2v。
At v, the same inequality also requires u > 2v.

110
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:23,000
合併兩式，u 要大過自己嘅四倍。正數 u 做唔到。
Together they require u > 4u, which is impossible for positive u.

111
00:23:23,000 --> 00:23:37,000
第 3 項起都唔可以高過 1，所以第 2023 項亦至多係 1。
No term from index 3 onward can exceed 1, including a₂₀₂₃.

112
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:47,000
每項都等於 1 時，原不等式取等號。
The all-ones sequence attains equality in the original inequality.

113
00:23:47,000 --> 00:23:53,000
用倒數平方，每次加 1。代入零可排除 A 至 D。
The reciprocal square rises by 1. Zero rules out A through D.

114
00:23:53,000 --> 00:23:59,000
兩個等式相乘，利用 3 與 5 相乘得 15。
Multiply the two equations and use 3 × 5 = 15.

115
00:23:59,000 --> 00:24:05,000
先除以 n＋1 見到倍增，再寫成相鄰差相消。
Divide by n + 1 to see doubling, then telescope the differences.

116
00:24:05,000 --> 00:24:11,000
每種最多 14 個，最短配置都要 400，超出 399。
With at most 14 per length, even the shortest packing needs 400.

117
00:24:11,000 --> 00:24:17,000
兩個根式相等時，和到達最大。
The sum is largest when the two square roots are equal.

118
00:24:17,000 --> 00:24:23,000
通分並抽出公因式，剩下邊長係 |a−b| 嘅正方形。
Clear the denominators to reveal a square of side |a − b|.

119
00:24:23,000 --> 00:24:29,000
比較兩個平方根係相同定相反，決定邊一式為零。
Equal or opposite roots determine which expression is zero.

120
00:24:29,000 --> 00:24:35,000
抽走兩個短窗口，迫使任意 m≥2 都整除首項。
Remove two short windows to force every m ≥ 2 to divide the first term.

121
00:24:35,000 --> 00:24:41,000
遞減函數迫出相對兩項相等，再解兩條分支。
The decreasing function matches opposite terms. Solve both branches.

122
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:47,000
拆面積求邊比，配合弧中點同夾角證相似。
Split the area, then use the arc midpoint and the included angle.

123
00:24:47,000 --> 00:24:53,000
相鄰兩項一旦高過 1，兩個高度限制互相矛盾。
A positive pair above 1 would impose contradictory height bounds.

124
00:24:53,000 --> 00:24:59,000
揀一道題，用自己嘅話講返關鍵一步。
Choose one problem and explain its key move in your own words.
